ckout</div>\\n</div>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n  <h1>High-Quality Yoga Gear at Amazing Prices</h1>\\n  <p>Everything you need to grow your studio, event, or personal practice.</p>\\n  <a class=\\\"btn-primary\\\" href=\\\"/yoga-mats/\\\">Shop Now</a>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"featured\\\">\\n  <h2>Featured Products</h2>\\n  <div class=\\\"product-grid\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"product-card\\\">\\n      <img src=\\\"/images/products/classic-yoga-mat.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Classic Yoga Mat\\\">\\n      <h3><a href=\\\"/classic-yoga-mat/\\\">Classic Yoga Mat</a></h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\">$14.95</div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"product-card\\\">\\n      <img src=\\\"/images/products/foam-yoga-block.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Foam Yoga Block\\\">\\n      <h3><a href=\\\"/foam-yoga-block/\\\">Foam Yoga Block</a></h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\">$7.95</div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"product-card\\\">\\n      <img src=\\\"/images/products/yoga-bolster.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Yoga Bolster\\\">\\n      <h3><a href=\\\"/yoga-bolster/\\\">Yoga Bolster</a></h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\">$29.95</div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"product-card\\\">\\n      <img src=\\\"/images/products/cotton-yoga-blanket.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Cotton Yoga Blanket\\\">\\n      <h3><a href=\\\"/cotton-yoga-blanket/\\\">Cotton Yoga Blanket</a></h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\">$19.95</div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"about\\\">\\n  <p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the Yoga community since 1999 and are confident that we can help you grow your studio, event, or personal practice with everything you need and more. We manufacture and source our own goods which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow n