 border-radius: 4px;\\n    margin-left: 6px;\\n    font-weight: 700;\\n  }\\n</style>\\n</head>\\n<body>\\n\\n  <!-- Sticky announcement bar with free shipping threshold and limited-time discount code -->\\n  <div class=\\\"HDLmClassc4c19f5\\\" role=\\\"banner\\\" aria-label=\\\"Promotional announcement\\\">\\n    Free Shipping on Orders Over $75 &nbsp;|&nbsp; Save 15% Sitewide for a Limited Time — Use Code <span class=\\\"discount-code\\\">SAVE15</span> at Checkout! <a href=\\\"/shop\\\">Shop Now &rarr;</a>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <header>\\n    <div class=\\\"logo\\\">YogaDirect</div>\\n    <nav>\\n      <ul>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/mats\\\">Yoga Mats</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/props\\\">Props</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/apparel\\\">Apparel</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/accessories\\\">Accessories</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/about\\\">About Us</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/contact\\\">Contact</a></li>\\n      </ul>\\n    </nav>\\n  </header>\\n\\n  <section class=\\\"hero\\\">\\n    <h1>Featured Products</h1>\\n  </section>\\n\\n  <section class=\\\"featured-products\\\">\\n    <p>Thanks to our loyal customers, YogaDirect has become one of the largest suppliers of yoga mats and props in the country. We have been faithfully supplying the Yoga community since 1999 and are confident that we can help you grow your studio, event, or personal practice with everything you need and more. We manufacture and source our own goods which is how we can consistently offer high-quality yoga gear at amazing prices. When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the Yoga community as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p>\\n  </section>\\n\\n  <footer>\\n    &copy; 1999-2025 YogaDirect. All rights reserved.\\n  </footer>\\n\\n</body>\\n</html>\\n\",\"improvements\":[{\"What\":\"Added a sticky announcement bar at the very top of the page displaying