ss=\\\"product-card\\\">\\n      <img src=\\\"/images/mat-1.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Premium Yoga Mat\\\">\\n      <h3>Premium Extra-Thick Yoga Mat</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\">$29.99</div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"product-card\\\">\\n      <img src=\\\"/images/block-1.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Cork Yoga Block\\\">\\n      <h3>Natural Cork Yoga Block</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\">$14.99</div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"product-card\\\">\\n      <img src=\\\"/images/strap-1.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Yoga Strap\\\">\\n      <h3>Cotton Yoga Strap, 8ft</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\">$8.99</div>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"product-card\\\">\\n      <img src=\\\"/images/bolster-1.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"Yoga Bolster\\\">\\n      <h3>Round Yoga Bolster</h3>\\n      <div class=\\\"price\\\">$39.99</div>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n</section>\\n\\n<section class=\\\"about-strip\\\">\\n  <p>When you shop at YogaDirect, feel proud in knowing that you are helping to grow not only your business or personal practice but the Yoga community as a whole. From our team of Yoga lovers to you, thank you.</p>\\n</section>\\n\\n<footer>\\n  <div class=\\\"footer-grid\\\">\\n    <div class=\\\"footer-col\\\">\\n      <h4>Shop</h4>\\n      <ul>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/mats\\\">Yoga Mats</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/props\\\">Props &amp; Accessories</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/apparel\\\">Apparel</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/sale\\\">Sale Items</a></li>\\n      </ul>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"footer-col\\\">\\n      <h4>Company</h4>\\n      <ul>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/about\\\">Our Story</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/wholesale\\\">Wholesale</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/careers\\\">Careers</a></li>\\n        <li><a href=\\\"/reviews\\\">Customer Reviews</a></li>\\n      </ul>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"footer-col\\\">\\n      <h4>Contact Us</h4>\\n      <ul>\\n        <li>Email: support@yogadirect.com</li>\\n        <li>Phone: 1-800-555-0199</li>\\n        <li>Mon-Fri, 9am-5pm EST</li>\\n      </ul>\\n    </div>\\n    <div class=\\\"footer-col\\\">\\n      <h4>Newsletter</h4>\\n      <p style=\\\"font-size:14px; margin-bottom:8px;\\\">Sign up for exclusive offers and yoga tips.</p>\\n      <form class=\\\"newsletter-form\\\">\\n        <input type=\\\"email\\\" placeholder=\\\"Your email address\\\" aria-label=\\\"Email address\\\">\\n        <button type=\\\"submit\\\">Sign Up</button>\\n      </form>\\n    </div>\\n  </div>\\n\\n  <div class=\\\"footer-bottom\\\">\\n    <div>&copy; 2025 YogaDirect. All rights reserved. Serving the Yoga community since 1999.</div>\\n    <div class=\\\"payment-icons HDLmClass3975f25d\\\" role=\\\"group\\\" aria-label=\\\"Accepted payment methods\\\">\\n      <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 48 32\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-label=\\\"Visa\\\"><rect width=\\\"48\\\" height=\\\"32\\\" rx=\\\"4\\\" fill=\\\"#fff\\\"/><text x=\\\"24\\\" y=\\\"21\\\" font-family=\\\"Arial, sans-serif\\\" font-size=\\\"13\\\" font-weight=\\\"700\\\" fill=\\\"#1a1f71\\\" text-anchor=\\\"middle\\\">VISA</text></svg>\\n      <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 48 32\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-label=\\\"Mastercard\\\"><rect width=\\\"48\\\" height=\\\"32\\\" rx=\\\"4\\\" fill=\\\"#fff\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"20\\\" cy=\\\"16\\\" r=\\\"9\\\" fill=\\\"#eb001b\\\"/><circle cx=\\\"28\\\" cy=\\\"16\\\" r=\\\"9\\\" fill=\\\"#f79e1b\\\" fill-opacity=\\\"0.9\\\"/></svg>\\n      <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 48 32\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-label=\\\"PayPal\\\"><rect width=\\\"48\\\" height=\\\"32\\\" rx=\\\"4\\\" fill=\\\"#fff\\\"/><text x=\\\"24\\\" y=\\\"21\\\" font-family=\\\"Arial, sans-serif\\\" font-size=\\\"11\\\" font-weight=\\\"700\\\" fill=\\\"#003087\\\" text-anchor=\\\"middle\\\">PayPal</text></svg>\\n      <svg viewBox=\\\"0 0 48 32\\\" xmlns=\\\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\\\" aria-label=\\\"American Express\\\"><rect width=\\\"48\\\" height=\\\"32\\\